    "name":  "LED Emergency Light 400Lm + Ceiling Kit - Auto Test + Permanent Light Option - IP20 - 6500K",
    "reference":  "ATEST91781",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLED Emergency Light\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003eAuto Test and Ceiling Kit\u003c/strong\u003e: ensures reliable lighting in critical situations. With \u003cstrong\u003e2W in permanent mode and 4W in emergency mode\u003c/strong\u003e, it provides bright light of \u003cstrong\u003e6500K and 400 lumens\u003c/strong\u003e thanks to SMD2835 technology. Its rechargeable \u003cstrong\u003e3.6V, 2000mAh battery\u003c/strong\u003e guarantees ideal autonomy.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasy to install and highly efficient, it’s the perfect solution for homes, offices, and shops. Safety and performance in one product!\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Emergency Light 400Lm + Ceiling Kit - Auto Test + Permanent Light Option - IP20 - 6500K\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLED Emergency Light 400Lm with Ceiling Kit and Self Test - The Efficient and Versatile Solution for Safety in Your Space\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eLED Emergency Light 400Lm\u003c/strong\u003e is a device designed to ensure reliable and effective lighting in critical situations, such as power outages or unexpected emergencies. This product combines advanced technology, energy efficiency and ease of use to offer a complete and adaptable solution for different environments.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTechnical Highlights:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDual Power\u003c/strong\u003e: Operates with 2W in permanent mode and 4W in emergency mode, ensuring bright and suitable lighting for various applications.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh Luminous Efficiency\u003c/strong\u003e: Thanks to SMD2835 LED technology, it provides a luminous flux of 400 lumens with a color temperature of 6500K, ideal for spaces that require a clear and sharp light.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRechargeable Battery\u003c/strong\u003e: Equipped with a 3.6V 2000mAh battery, it guarantees up to 3 hours of autonomy in emergency mode, enough to overcome prolonged power interruptions.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntegrated Self-Test\u003c/strong\u003e: Includes a self-test function that automatically checks the system status, ensuring its correct operation at all times.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProtection and Durability\u003c/strong\u003e: IP20 rated, it is designed for indoor use, offering protection against solid elements such as dust.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Lighting Options\u003c/strong\u003e: In addition to emergency mode, it includes a permanent light option, making it adaptable to specific lighting needs.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes EXIT Sign\u003c/strong\u003e: EXIT signage stands out for its visibility, effectively directing people to emergency exits.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe compact and modern design of this emergency light includes a ceiling kit that facilitates its installation in ceilings of different types. Its optimized size allows it to be perfectly integrated into any space without compromising the aesthetics of the place.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses and Applications of LED Emergency Light 400Lm with Permanent Light Option\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHomes: Ideal to ensure security and tranquility in power outages.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOffices and Commercial Spaces: Provides immediate and reliable lighting for employees and customers.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePublic Spaces: Perfect for corridors, stairways and emergency exits in public buildings.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWarehouses and Industries: Provides essential lighting to ensure operability in times of emergency.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn Factorled we ensure that our products have QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT OR WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gtx-trans\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"gtx-trans-icon\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
